20:08Z","body":"So some immediate feedback from IRL cases, this depends on compression ratio naturally but these are some examples of the savings thanks to this (comparing caches from before this was merged and new builds, in cache upload sizes, for the same PR):\r\n* macOS editor: ~560 MB -> ~300 MB\r\n* Linux Thread Sanitizer: ~1.1 GB -> 860 MB\r\n* Linux Editor Mono: ~300 MB -> ~200 MB\r\n* Android Editor: ~500 MB -> ~200 MB\r\n* Windows Editor: ~600 MB -> ~360 MB\r\n\r\nWill push an update to one of my PRs which has old caches and compare them too with a complete net change","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2539399848/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]